@startuml DeploymentDiagram
!theme plain
top to bottom direction

title Sơ đồ triển khai hạ tầng BrewLite (AWS & Docker)

node "Client Device" {
  [Browser / Mobile App (PWA)] as ClientApp
}

node "AWS Cloud (ap-southeast-1)" {
  
  node "EC2 Instance (Ubuntu 24.04 LTS)" as EC2 {
    folder "Docker Engine" {
      node "Container: apps/web" as WebContainer {
        [Next.js PWA (Port 3000)] as NextServer
      }
      
      node "Container: apps/api" as ApiContainer {
        [NestJS API Server (Port 3001)] as NestApi
      }
    }
    
    [Security Group: Port 80, 443, 3001] as EC2SecGroup
  }

  node "Amazon RDS Service" as RDSNode {
    database "PostgreSQL Instance (Port 5432)" as DBInstance {
      [brewlite-db (Persistent Storage)] as PostgresDB
    }
    [Security Group: Port 5432] as RDSSecGroup
  }

  node "GitHub Services" as GitHubCloud {
    [GitHub Repository (Monorepo)] as Repo
    [GitHub Actions (CI/CD Pipeline)] as Pipeline
  }
}

ClientApp --> NextServer : HTTP/HTTPS (Port 80/443)
ClientApp --> NestApi : HTTP/REST API (Port 3001)
NestApi --> PostgresDB : DATABASE_URL (Port 5432)
Pipeline --> Repo : Trigger on PR/Push
Pipeline ..> WebContainer : Build Check
Pipeline ..> ApiContainer : Build Check

note right of EC2SecGroup
  Đã cấu hình Inbound Rule:
  Custom TCP 3001 cho phép Anywhere (0.0.0.0/0)
end note

note right of PostgresDB
  Lưu trữ dữ liệu bền vững (Persistent)
  Public Access: Yes (Cho phép EC2 truy cập)
end note

@enduml

